Relax a GOTPCREL load only when its addend is -4, as lld does. With another addend the
instruction reads part of the GOT entry, e.g. clang loads the high half of a pointer with
movl sym@GOTPCREL+4(%rip), so rewriting it to lea gave erlang's JIT corrupt pointers.

